@page
@{
	ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
	ViewData["Description"] = "Privacy Policy for FitVis Nutrition application.";
	ViewData["Author"] = "Jan Sebastián Kostlán";
	ViewData["Keywords"] = "privacy, privacy policy, fitvis";
	ViewData["nofollow"] = true;
}
<main class="main">
<header class="header__other fadeInLeft visible">
	<h1 class="header__h1">Privacy Policy</h1>
	<p class="header__p">Last updated: April 15, 2026. FitVis Nutrition is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and share information when you use our mobile application.</p>
</header>
	<h2 class="h2__div__article red">1. Information We Collect</h2>
	<h3 class="red">A. Camera Access</h3>
	<p>The App requires access to your device's camera to enable food recognition features. This allows you to take photos of your meals to automatically track nutritional data.</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Use:</strong> Images are processed to identify food items.</li>
		<li><strong>Storage:</strong> Photos are not permanently stored on our servers unless explicitly saved by the user.</li>
	</ul>

	<h3 class="red">B. Health and Nutritional Data</h3>
	<p>We collect data about the food items you search for or recognize via camera to provide calorie and nutrient tracking.</p>

	<h3 class="red">C. Personal Information</h3>
	<p>If you create an account, we may collect your email address and basic profile information (name, age, weight) to personalize nutritional calculations.</p>

	<h2 class="red h2__div__article">2. Use of Information</h2>
	<p>We use the collected information to identify food items, track your progress logs, and improve our recognition algorithms.</p>

	<h2 class="red h2__div__article">3. Data Sharing</h2>
	<p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share anonymized data with service providers or AI APIs strictly for processing application queries.</p>

	<h2 class="red h2__div__article">4. Security</h2>
	<p>We implement standard security measures to protect your data. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.</p>

	<h2 class="red h2__div__article">5. Contact Us</h2>
	<p>If you have any questions about this policy, contact me at: <a class="red" href="mailto:info@kostlanovec.cz">info@kostlanovec.cz</a></p>
</main>
